        <item>
            <title>0.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:20:19 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://freeside.banast.as</link>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Uses far less CPU: about 0.13 % while showing live rates, down from 1.8 %. Free space is no longer re-read in full every time a drive writes, and the menu bar no longer redraws several times per update.</li>
  <li>An app icon: a drive with a capacity bar</li>
  <li>The popover's header shows how many external drives are attached and their total free space; Eject All moves to the footer</li>
  <li>The popover opens a little faster</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
